         ->  Sort
               Sort Key: d.id
               ->  Custom Scan (ParadeDB Base Scan) on docs d
                     Filter: (NOT (org_id IS DISTINCT FROM (NULLIF(current_setting('app.org_id'::text, true), ''::text))::integer))
                     Table: docs
                     Index: docs_bm25
                     Exec Method: NormalScanExecState
